One library package whose exported declaration nothing references, carrying a
directive whose code the severity map leaves at deny. The class of an exported
declaration of a library with no consumer information is possible, so a run that
raises the minimum confidence above it makes the record dormant by that arm alone
rather than by the severity arm.

